+# SpringGear JDK 26 migration
+
+Validated scope is the existing four-module reactor: build, parent, core and BOM.
+Compiler release 26, Lombok 1.18.48 explicitly configured as annotation processor,
+Spring Framework 7.0.9 and Surefire 3.5.5. Public SpringGear source is unchanged.
+Run `mvn -B -ntp verify` using JDK 26. Expect 14 JUnit tests, zero failures/errors/skips,
+and class major version 70. The earlier compile-only build contained no tests and
+is not the acceptance result. The active reactor contains no javax Servlet API;
+disabled historical web/extension modules are outside this migration and are not
+claimed compatible with Spring 7. Java 8 binary compatibility is intentionally not claimed.
+No Maven deployment/release goal or upstream branch update is performed.
